{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2021-07", "window": 3, "start_date": 1626393600, "end_date": 1627084799, "month_true_total": 1379, "quota": 9, "returned": 9, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:48:50 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "96264032", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037462034", "personaname": "Rōnin Style", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KaoticKarma/", "num_games_owned": 361, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 3114, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1904, "last_played": 1770268208, "avatar": "67ea7ea8919965871cb5af1e4c8453088114c9da"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bought it on sale for under ~10, and I have to say Gunfire has easily been one of the more entertaining roguelikes, and games for that matter, that I've played in the last 5 years. Really hooks you with it's fun matchmaking, friendliness towards newbies, and ability to challenge yourself later on as well. I've played nearly 30 hours so far with 0 bugs and it's still in EA. \n\nThe talent tree is fleshed out and well balanced in my opinion, they're are some further tweaks that are definitely necessary to secure longevity for this game, but as it stands now it is a great product more than worth the full price imo. If you can find it on sale though, it's a definite purchase for me.\n\n30 hours in at the time of writing this and my talent tree isn't fully filled out yet, I do though have all the characters unlocked as well as every scroll but one available. It's a great time with friends, solo and in matchmaking. Highly recommended!", "timestamp_created": 1627084728, "timestamp_updated": 1627084792, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "96262843", "author": {"steamid": "76561198139250094", "personaname": "Changeling", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/change1ing/", "num_games_owned": 183, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 1622, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1084, "last_played": 1769533818, "avatar": "c857d453dffd45a7403c617356e9ebf1fb9fe460"}, "language": "english", "review": "I bought this game on a whim and ugh does it consume my soul. Simplistic enough where you can just vibe and listen to music and unwind after a long day, but complex enough where you really have to plan what weapons are best for your character, what talents you should invest in, and so on. The price is definitely worth the amount of time you'll get out of this game, and the devs are actively working on getting it out of Early Access. So excited to see where this game goes!", "timestamp_created": 1627082534, "timestamp_updated": 1627082534, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "96261975", "author": {"steamid": "76561198112754153", "personaname": "denis", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dynyhrb/", "num_games_owned": 409, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 4370, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 324, "last_played": 1757107613, "avatar": "8d770ff0d4495a32f7deedf9ca3441d3c4e16b1d"}, "language": "english", "review": "yes", "timestamp_created": 1627081042, "timestamp_updated": 1627081042, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primari